---
// Trois façons de corriger un design, toutes décrites dans la documentation :
// la conversation, un commentaire posé sur un élément, la retouche à la main.
---

<figure class="ca-figure is-narrow dsr">
  <div class="dsr-stage" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="dsr-board">
      <p class="dsr-title">Recettes de famille<span class="ca-pin">2</span></p>
      <p class="dsr-note">Plus grand, ce titre.</p>
      <div class="dsr-photos">
        <i></i>
        <i class="dsr-picked"><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><span class="ca-pin">3</span></i>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="dsr-chat">Des couleurs plus chaudes partout.<span class="ca-pin">1</span></p>
  </div>
  <ol class="ca-legend">
    <li><span>Dans la conversation : les grands changements.</span></li>
    <li><span>Un commentaire sur un élément : une retouche précise.</span></li>
    <li><span>À la main : déplacer, agrandir, aligner.</span></li>
  </ol>
</figure>

<style>
  .dsr-stage {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.9rem;
    padding: 1.4rem 1.2rem 1.1rem 2rem;
    border: 2px solid var(--ink);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background: var(--surface);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-block);
  }

  .dsr-stage p { margin: 0; line-height: 1.3; }

  .dsr-board {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    padding: 1rem;
    border: 2px solid var(--ink);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: #fff7ea;
  }

  .dsr-stage .dsr-title {
    position: relative;
    justify-self: start;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .dsr-stage .dsr-note {
    justify-self: start;
    margin-block-start: -0.5rem;
    padding: 0.3rem 0.6rem;
    border: 2px solid var(--ink);
    border-radius: 0 10px 10px 10px;
    background: var(--brick-yellow);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .dsr-photos {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .dsr-photos i {
    position: relative;
    block-size: 4.5rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f2c26b, #d98a3d);
  }

  .dsr-photos .dsr-picked {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #a9c98a, #5f8f4e);
    outline: 2px solid var(--brick-blue);
    outline-offset: 3px;
  }

  /* Les quatre poignées de la retouche à la main. */
  .dsr-picked b {
    position: absolute;
    inline-size: 0.55rem;
    block-size: 0.55rem;
    border: 2px solid var(--brick-blue);
    background: #fff;
  }

  .dsr-picked b:nth-child(1) { inset: -8px auto auto -8px; }
  .dsr-picked b:nth-child(2) { inset: -8px -8px auto auto; }
  .dsr-picked b:nth-child(3) { inset: auto auto -8px -8px; }
  .dsr-picked b:nth-child(4) { inset: auto -8px -8px auto; }

  .dsr-stage .dsr-chat {
    position: relative;
    padding: 0.55rem 0.8rem;
    border: 2px solid var(--ink);
    border-radius: 12px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .dsr .ca-pin {
    inline-size: 1.5rem;
    block-size: 1.5rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }

  .dsr-title .ca-pin { inset: 50% auto auto -1.9rem; translate: 0 -50%; }
  .dsr-picked .ca-pin { inset: 50% auto auto 50%; translate: -50% -50%; }
  .dsr-chat .ca-pin { inset: 50% auto auto -1.7rem; translate: 0 -50%; }
</style>
